sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Browser or API client
  participant R as route() wrapper<br/>lib/forge/http.ts
  participant A as brandRequest / apiCaller
  participant D as Domain function<br/>lib/forge/*
  participant DB as Postgres (RLS)

  C->>R: HTTP request
  R->>A: resolve who is calling
  alt Signed-in person
    A->>A: Supabase session cookie, active workspace, role
  else API key or MCP
    A->>A: hash fx_ key, check scopes, 600 requests an hour
  end
  A-->>R: ForgeContext (user, workspace, role, scopes)
  R->>R: parse body with zod (parseJson)
  R->>D: call with the context
  D->>DB: query scoped to user or workspace
  DB-->>D: rows the policies allow
  D-->>R: result
  R-->>C: JSON, or HttpError mapped to a status code
